# App colours

Use these colours in the Home Assistant Companion app and on screens that behave like an app. Lead with Primary blue and Accent teal, from the first screen to the controls. For text, links, focus and error colours, use the [functional colours](colour-web.html#functional-colours).

The app palette has every primary colour, tint, shade and accent, plus 2 dark mode blues.

